        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to immerse yourself in a cozy atmosphere with unobtrusive Lo-Fi music and express your creativity in home decoration? Go ahead!<br>­<br><strong>In our little game, you can:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >­<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various plants and other objects to decorate the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorn the walls with different graffiti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add stylish signs and control their lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the walls styles and adjust the building's height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even take control of the sun and weather!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And don't forget to simply admire the cherry blossoms ⌛</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to immerse yourself in a cozy atmosphere with unobtrusive Lo-Fi music and express your creativity in home decoration? Go ahead!<br>­<br><strong>In our little game, you can:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >­<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various plants and other objects to decorate the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorn the walls with different graffiti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add stylish signs and control their lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the walls styles and adjust the building's height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even take control of the sun and weather!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And don't forget to simply admire the cherry blossoms ⌛</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
